{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "e1ec72132fc5d83e3a19be16e3fb29063393545ebb858dbabb320e3bd22242c0", "ja": "雨のように、花のように", "zh": "宛如细雨，宛如繁花", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "fe8fd2169b7369f7f03bcdc433b10b9621e78b9ad5511f8640164dcd55bf6993", "ja": "オフの日、桃子が花壇の様子を見に行くと、\n風花が手入れをしていた。話し合い、仲直り\nするふたり。見守っていたこのみとプロデュ\nーサーも合流し、天体公演に向けてユニット\nの気持ちはひとつになるのだった。", "zh": "休息日，桃子去查看花坛的情况时，\n发现风花正在打理。两人交谈后重归于好。\n一直在旁守望的这个美和制作人也加入进来，\n为了天体公演，组合成员的心意终于合而为一。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "19367d2f0b255adc0cbf27b52978fe1a7e5c72ddd1e5fed0277142ecf882e3d5", "ja": "（今日は『ジェミニ』のレッスンはオフ。桃子が\n花壇を見に行くと言うので、一緒に行く事にした）", "zh": "（今天是《双子座》的休息日。桃子说要去看看花坛，于是我决定和她一起去）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "1c5f6dc0efc7bbb3079cb92b6762fc0cf1221477c11dff983dfe4e38edff2395", "ja": "ねえお兄ちゃん、どうしてついてくるの？\n桃子、ひとりで行くって言ったはずだけど。", "zh": "喂，哥哥，你为什么要跟过来？\n桃子明明说过要一个人去的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1002_p", "source_sha256": "db094d32fb7d6a61d1169452125351d729b55c8d7e651b67a96110a7bda64168", "ja": "ああ、そう聞いたよ。ただ俺も、\n花壇の様子が気になるから、行こうと思っただけだ。", "zh": "啊，是听你这么说的。不过我只是也有点在意花坛的情况，所以打算一起去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "176ad43805a41a08d87912ddc383b177139729c187ae9cb8666f06f1c6181092", "ja": "ふーん……。\nまあ、そういうことにしておいてあげる。", "zh": "哦……这样啊。\n好吧，就当是这么回事吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1005_p", "source_sha256": "702207d768ca68e8f326f699dd3319b429da5b299b1de23887ba046f481edeb7", "ja": "っと……仕事の電話だ。\n桃子、悪いけど先に行っててくれるか？", "zh": "等等……是工作的电话。\n桃子，抱歉，你先过去可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "46a743ea2842bb5522b57a84e549585036e4928e664b4a33bf6ef491e9601140", "ja": "だから、桃子ひとりで大丈夫だってば。\nお兄ちゃん、歩きスマホしちゃダメだよ？　じゃあね。", "zh": "所以都说了，桃子一个人没问题的啦。\n哥哥，不可以边走路边玩手机哦？那再见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "6e7b62fde1da49b8955953aca81af2790230bb826c0eb1159ea53c17f14ae059", "ja": "桃子だって、もう子どもじゃないんだから。\nひとりで大丈夫なのに……あれ？", "zh": "桃子也已经不是小孩子了。\n明明一个人也没问题的……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "d226f6289dba9595ba77aed93734d73b0324d3817f3c3c890c1e4ea30ea3c7e5", "ja": "花壇にいるのって……。", "zh": "花坛里的是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f2cdb95cd4779f2beddf3661edb1500b1d443cea2ecee6f12e91efd986b35a60", "ja": "ふぅ……こんなものかな？\n夜に雨が降ったからか、雑草を取るの簡単でよかった。", "zh": "呼……这样差不多了吧？\n可能是因为晚上下过雨，杂草很好拔，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "ddf00d9791becd62c53509ea1ec17572a354a7a26bb05c3f12050072e15f6ff3", "ja": "……ふ、風花さん！", "zh": "……风、风花小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c0f02a0f6d1fc05ece11c37a39fa6282155b8513bfe53f2ea695ec0b683a5d81", "ja": "えっ？　あっ、桃子ちゃん！\nどうしたの？　今日はオフだったよね。", "zh": "诶？啊，桃子！\n怎么了？今天不是休息日吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "f19429a1b88c0a72a3a09582aa6882937ba138c713904d8673a9bc57cc074d13", "ja": "それはこっちのセリフだよ。桃子は、花壇を\n見にきたんだけど……風花さんこそ、何してるの？", "zh": "这句话应该由我来说吧。桃子是来看花坛的……倒是风花姐，你在做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5a7571d20d8215827816f6a0d8b9a93a51d6971d9e7026981797a9757298454e", "ja": "私も同じだよ。\nちょっと雑草があったから手入れしてたんだ。", "zh": "我也一样。刚好看到有些杂草，就来整理了一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "697ff3d2b7fba181cf4437f689cc6272e349add1cd03d5ff788fa1a93e64a653", "ja": "そうなんだ……。\n……。", "zh": "这样啊……\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1017_p", "source_sha256": "1b16de3d9840c3baf2fbc7fe82eb7edef0a284ee8739576281116fca3385baca", "ja": "あっ……いたいた。\nお疲れさまです、このみさん。", "zh": "啊……找到了。\n辛苦了，木实。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "53978d8e9b52c4843d09ffe30ae259b209fcbd7ecafcea63c04c61f9930c3e65", "ja": "シーッ、静かに！　今、風花ちゃんと\n桃子ちゃんが、話しているところだから……。", "zh": "嘘，安静点！风花和桃子现在正在谈话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1019_p", "source_sha256": "eab6f463ac73aaaa46172f0411ee95d0c8091e46121a2963f1a547cf46965364", "ja": "ありがとうございます、このみさん。\n風花をフォローしてくれて。", "zh": "谢谢你，木美小姐。\n帮风花解了围。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1020_039kon", "source_sha256": "308031a12a1ed61b3e67ba7d16cb4191cdd4519fde1962b12c209052fb79199b", "ja": "あら、メンバーのケアをするのは年長者の役目よ。\nむしろ、桃子ちゃんと話してくれてありがとう。", "zh": "哎呀，照顾成员可是年长者的职责哦。倒是要谢谢你愿意和桃子聊聊天。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1021_039kon", "source_sha256": "af8aeaaf312f7088d1393370fecb8148a8366383b8a42dcfe4d4f946379f224f", "ja": "本当のことを言うと、私たちじゃ\n難しいかもしれないって思ってたの。", "zh": "说真的，我原本觉得，这件事可能不是我们能应付的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1022_039kon", "source_sha256": "54c06e1eabb67c0b250fa3bfbdc4991595114b5a85b4b3c7440b6bb9cef2fde7", "ja": "桃子ちゃん、家庭の事情を抱えてるでしょ？　そういう\nことって、仲間でも気安く触れるわけにはいかないし。", "zh": "桃子有家庭方面的难处吧？这种事情，就算是同伴也不能随便触及。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1023_p", "source_sha256": "8e3bf244b4644c436508aa078c0a02e072b8fbbe42716c90b952ec9a4484f88e", "ja": "このみさん……。", "zh": "木实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1024_039kon", "source_sha256": "75a89eb5f0fe36c1e995d3812444ebbd483f1783442819142a32e3eaf20a77f4", "ja": "もちろん、桃子ちゃんがいいって言えば、\n遠慮なんかしないわよ？　ううん、言わなくても……。", "zh": "当然，要是桃子觉得可以的话，\n我也不会跟你客气的哦？不，就算你不说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1025_039kon", "source_sha256": "eba650c986654f13a7bede6cc805e8d22c5f131c72079c5e1f80cfc89bdead87", "ja": "いつでも頼ったり甘えたりして欲しいって思ってるわ。\nもちろん、私だけでなく、風花ちゃんもね。", "zh": "我希望你随时都能依靠我，向我撒娇。\n当然，不只是我，风花也是一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1026_p", "source_sha256": "b269c55a5fa31207e729d90caa3d1752e28ef00b77de9efe6940169cfce3835c", "ja": "ありがとうございます。……ふたりの気持ちは、\n桃子もわかっていると思います。", "zh": "谢谢你们。……你们两人的这份心意，\n我想桃子心里也是明白的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1027_039kon", "source_sha256": "2059656594776583f0dc73eeebcb6a80f77b70fe8583eecb3901347c1f9d082d", "ja": "ふふ、そうよね。{$P$}も、私も……\nお互い、できることはしてると思うわ。", "zh": "呵呵，确实是这样呢。{$P$}也好，我也好……我想我们都在尽力做自己能做的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1028_039kon", "source_sha256": "fa98a30d673c56861a13831a331a64d209fb648f8bc75a2446d8fbc41c6f2bee", "ja": "それに私は、ふたりの強さを信じてるの。\n……だからもう少しだけ、見守ってあげましょ。", "zh": "而且，我相信你们两个人的实力。\n……所以，再守望一会儿吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1029_041fuk", "source_sha256": "767638261086c2b06932cf282e7a9ba6b02af2910785373c4615cb4451649164", "ja": "あ、あのね、桃子ちゃん。\nこの前は、ごめんなさい……。", "zh": "啊，那个，桃子。\n之前的事，对不起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1030_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c9580138ad1a29cb48aa08512d30022a046b44291904cb1fa68b32ec44ba95ad", "ja": "桃子ちゃんに指摘されて、気づいたの。\nあの子に無責任なことを言っちゃったなって。", "zh": "被桃子指出来后，我才意识到。\n我对那孩子说了不负责任的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1031_049mom", "source_sha256": "7bf1f24951018f290a8866843f6b3e7a77d3c078e9fea4de31cd0aa6169bca04", "ja": "ううん。風花さんが謝らなくていいよ。\nそれに、悪いのは桃子だから……。", "zh": "不用啦。风花小姐不需要道歉的。\n而且，错的明明是桃子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1032_049mom", "source_sha256": "81090ba2babd421c5e78e3c05921a7bff4c61b366f535a9c43fb109a0e7e62fb", "ja": "風花さんだって、わかってたよね。\n花が必ず咲くかなんて、誰にもわからないって。", "zh": "风花姐，你也知道的吧。\n花到底会不会开，谁也说不准。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1033_049mom", "source_sha256": "b4b23a337007bfc90b11079c9eea789f029e4f53c5c35aa2fd8d0e13f8bf260c", "ja": "それなのに桃子、いやな言い方しちゃった……。\n風花さんは、あの子を笑顔にしたかっただけなのに。", "zh": "可是桃子却说了那么难听的话……。\n风花明明只是想让那孩子露出笑容而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1034_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5de1aff7044f09e44b74f4f2c86bbf07b179dee225b02a91a35109df73a20c5f", "ja": "桃子ちゃん。\n……私ね、前に看護師のお仕事をしてたの。", "zh": "桃子。\n……我以前做过护士。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1035_041fuk", "source_sha256": "560c4f94ab04be3e2db5a4576a07ccacfeb61f2ff8da2386b7c1c50ef22803ef", "ja": "患者さんの中には、治らないって諦める人もいてね。\nでも気持ちが前を向くと良くなる人もいたんだ。", "zh": "患者中也有人会放弃，觉得自己的病治不好了。\n但也有人在心态积极起来后，病情就有所好转。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1037_041fuk", "source_sha256": "feb15a078652ae7c6de09e35c0937cc6281b8a39b4ba4e5ff58d95bf0621a140", "ja": "だから、絶対じゃないんだけど……\nあの子と一緒に、最後まで信じてみたいなって。", "zh": "所以，也不是绝对的……但我想和那个孩子一起，相信到最后。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1038_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1583ee4d6ab861814427a2932fe782c84fafdd55db6a85eee1077be2a893f8ac", "ja": "もし、悪い結果になったとしても……\nみんなとだったら、辛い気持ちを分け合えるでしょ？", "zh": "即使结果不尽如人意……  \n和大家一起的话，也能分担这份难过，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1039_049mom", "source_sha256": "5e554b91905ba00227b406f028629c593ffcedce6a90991c36008bd6186d8340", "ja": "風花さん……。", "zh": "风花姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1040_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a3b9e6d4ed2f6a8a912f1d989c10ba19c45d3286634dd65be7585f0a4ee7b4e3", "ja": "だから桃子ちゃんも……私たちと一緒に、\nあの子のお花が咲くって、信じてみてくれないかな？", "zh": "所以桃子也……要不要和我们一起，相信那孩子的花会绽放呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1041_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4ab7f7adf1cb91b070c19e4b70b18c8f7052296ad756ac9d6eb21af1964a781e", "ja": "もちろん、言葉だけじゃないよ。\nお花が元気になるように、お世話の方もね。", "zh": "当然，不仅是嘴上说说而已哦。\n为了让花恢复精神，照料方面也会做好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1042_049mom", "source_sha256": "bd1fe082bf5ba6a1ee38ab08ca294145bd0e1046d041ad672d96da41af2d901d", "ja": "う、うん……！　桃子も一緒にやる！\nちゃんと最後まで見届けたい！", "zh": "嗯、嗯……！桃子也一起做！想好好见证到最后！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1043_se", "source_sha256": "648aa71d5f5709fc64440e68470fe5b7bd4a452967aa757892fa6e67284207f9", "ja": "ガサガサ……ガサガサッ……", "zh": "沙沙……沙沙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1045_041fuk", "source_sha256": "30ed1522d4f2f052b0e8d8502d5c034c23172f14ab13121324231bf931005898", "ja": "へっ！？　な、何……？", "zh": "欸！？什、什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1046_039kon", "source_sha256": "f89f0bc65de10e6e5ae45898e2019d8c402ace6f38d3136c08efcfbd1346600e", "ja": "……ふぅ！", "zh": "……呼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1047_039kon", "source_sha256": "0054a7c1e9b1761e5540fe1dc8864554608fcfb681713afe729bd0ec58ef32ad", "ja": "ちょっとちょっと、私だけ仲間はずれ？\n同じユニットなんだし、話に入れてちょうだい。", "zh": "等等，等等，难道只有我被排除在外？\n我们可是同一个组合，让我也加入你们的谈话嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1048_p", "source_sha256": "ea124247ce87bb468326583abaf72bc21a5926407df255932ebfcdf6178d58c2", "ja": "お疲れさま、桃子、風花。\nレッスンに支障がでないよう、予定を調整しておくよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，桃子、风花。\n我会调整好日程，不让训练受到影响。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1049_041fuk", "source_sha256": "bfa40bffe2337bcdb833b474b604167e689db2500797d4d483c3b98baad9af33", "ja": "このみさん……それに{$P$}さん！？\nど、どうして草むらから……？", "zh": "木实姐……还有{$P$}先生！？  \n为、为什么会从草丛里……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1050_049mom", "source_sha256": "30fa29f549c54cad45e5bb10d9688494a2ae56e212c3239c1d51dff36036a80c", "ja": "お兄ちゃん、遅いよ！　もう。\nどうせこのみさんと一緒に、盗み聞きしてたんでしょ？", "zh": "哥哥，你来得太晚了！真是的。\n你肯定是和木实小姐一起躲在草丛里偷听吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1051_p", "source_sha256": "f6a15885d85c60a86ad51babdfaba93821dc2433079ffdb4fbc6a8f7cb8151e1", "ja": "いや、まあ……。\n出てくるタイミングが難しくて……。", "zh": "不是，那个……只是很难把握出来的时机……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1052_039kon", "source_sha256": "8c4a66d3a097b043525254dfad2576ac6c06d4e8c6565c033164fa52f8f0b7ec", "ja": "それじゃ、話がまとまったところで……\nみんなで花壇の手入れ、しちゃいましょうか？", "zh": "那么，既然已经商量好了……大家一起去照料花坛吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1053_039kon", "source_sha256": "f1f7e072d194eefb96688a2a895cd372df1c4ee1d975dac393c3d6fd5139aaed", "ja": "それが終わったら、レッスンなんてどうかしら？\n{$P$}。", "zh": "等那件事结束后，去上训练课怎么样？\n{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1054_049mom", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1055_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1056_039kon", "source_sha256": "efce83010d9082ab37008364aab8e794ad9697e2cbfa53eb061ceb1b5ea30e2a", "ja": "今なら、とってもいい仕上がりになると思うんだけど。\nどう？", "zh": "我觉得现在做出来的效果会非常好。\n怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1057_p", "source_sha256": "78cc84a61e7c69ae7050d60fb4faa68f890e69cdea7af54e7b38e579c4648db6", "ja": "そうですね、できればオフはしっかり休んで\n欲しいところですけど……。", "zh": "是啊，要是可以的话，还是希望你能在休息日好好休息……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1058_041fuk", "source_sha256": "54929657b89435af18537c9417166bd28593f99ee7342ad59ead1060afbf40c7", "ja": "そうですね。\n今なら、いつもよりもっと息が合いそう。", "zh": "是啊。\n现在的话，感觉应该能比平时更加合拍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1059_p", "source_sha256": "5c8c846f4a24d931cf7c537b254784f39c92add0844caad65ff385818ad4da1b", "ja": "わかった、レッスンの予約を入れておくよ。\nもちろん、俺も立ち会わせてもらうからな！", "zh": "明白了，我来预约课程。\n当然，我也会到场陪同！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1060_049mom", "source_sha256": "c16dadc486d4146953eab105ec2aa16cee3ef5ed64eda4af2bd17e80ce47b54b", "ja": "もう、お兄ちゃん！？\nどうしてこういう時だけ、行動が早いの！", "zh": "真是的，哥哥！？\n为什么偏偏只有这种时候，行动这么快！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1061_049mom", "source_sha256": "fe8a2c283480296faad60d19acd62671e01bc3496ab22f0bebac2e18a7865d72", "ja": "このみさんもお兄ちゃんもうれしそうにして。\nほんと、わかりやすいんだから……。", "zh": "连木美小姐和哥哥都一副很开心的样子。\n真是的，太好懂了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1062_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5103e5cc373e42cc135cbe49633b32b3e558c3bd981b295c78d8a94fb5957192", "ja": "ふふっ。\nでも、それだけ心配させてたってことだよね。", "zh": "呵呵。\n不过，这也说明我让你那么担心了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1063_049mom", "source_sha256": "b74f464ca37f9f725e324c0ea24dbff4b005bef5957ec77bdce544fc10ec55c1", "ja": "うっ。それは、そうだけど……。", "zh": "呜……话是这么说啦……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1064_039kon", "source_sha256": "660b5080a4311f221109223fc9916f40b9c70b58608b0ef523fb9832c4e1ce2a", "ja": "さ、まずは花壇からよ！\n{$P$}も手伝ってちょうだい。", "zh": "那么，先从花坛开始吧！\n{$P$}先生也来帮忙吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1065_049mom", "source_sha256": "4503f4df3e89e38fc366a191ed3701b7075b3697d03a3db50d61f9ec4eeb2d7d", "ja": "うん！／はい！", "zh": "嗯！／好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1066_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_06_1067_p", "source_sha256": "1c84f53f55ad2a93ea134ccbb95e21a6774f22bb3cb2a614dd64f029f848dcd5", "ja": "（雨降って地固まる、ってところか。よし、気合い\n入れていくぞ……ひとまず、花壇の手入れだな！）", "zh": "（这就叫雨过地更坚吧。好，打起精神来……先把花坛收拾好！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
